cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PSDG in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "PSDG — Philosopher's Stone Dice Game"
abstract: >-
  A small deterministic dice game with an exact solver, used as a benchmark for two measurable
  failure modes: representation insufficiency (a learner that solves the full-state game fails
  under a lossy tops-only state, an enumerable regret floor) and deployment fragility (a frozen
  oracle-derived plan is exploitable once the opponent leaves the expected line).
type: software
authors:
